  "body": " Write the inequality in interval notation:   Solution: This inequality says that is between 2 and 4, including 4, not including 2. So, we write the interval (2,4] We put the smaller number, 2, on the left side of the interval. We put a parenthesis next to 2 because it is not included. We put a bracket next to 4 because it is included.  "
