  "number": "8.3.1",
  "title": "",
  "body": " Solve the inequality and write your answer in interval notation.   Solution: We start by subtracting 1 from all three parts, so that only variable terms are left in the center:  Then we divide all three parts by 2, to get rid of the multiplied 2 on the :  This says that can be between -4 and 4, including -4, but not including 4. In interval notation, that would be   "
